        "explanation": "<p>Use the binomial expansion formula: $(a + b)^n = \\sum_{k=0}^{n} \\binom{n}{k} a^{n-k} b^k$.<br><br>Here, $a = 2x$, $b = -3$, and $n = 5$.<br><br>The general term is $\\binom{5}{k} (2x)^{5 - k} (-3)^k$.<br><br>For the coefficient of $x^3$, set $5 - k = 3 \\Rightarrow k = 2$.<br><br>The term is $\\binom{5}{2} (2x)^3 (-3)^2 = 10 \\cdot 8x^3 \\cdot 9 = 720x^3$.<br><br>The coefficient is $720$.</p>",
